1397+ 93D2                  ; Prioridad: E/W sobre N/S
1398+ 93D2 CB 57            BIT 2, A
1399+ 93D4 20 0C            JR NZ, .runE
1400+ 93D6 CB 5F            BIT 3, A
1401+ 93D8 20 10            JR NZ, .runW
