1683+ 9551                  ; AABB con margen de 8px (1 celda) por cada lado:
1684+ 9551                  ; playerX < wellX+24 AND wellX-8 < playerX+16
1685+ 9551                  ; playerY < wellY+24 AND wellY-8 < playerY+21
1686+ 9551                  ; --- Check X ---
