1689+ 9556 4F               LD C, A
1690+ 9557 3A 85 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)      ; A = playerX
1691+ 955A B9               CP C                                ; playerX < wellRight+margen?
1692+ 955B 30 39            JR NC, .cwNoOverlap                 ; no → fuera
1693+ 955D 3A 85 80         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)
1694+ 9560 C6 18            ADD A, 24                           ; C = playerX + 16 + 8 (playerRight + margen)
1695+ 9562 4F               LD C, A
1696+ 9563 3A 76 87         LD A, (WellPosX)                    ; A = wellX
1697+ 9566 B9               CP C                                ; wellX < playerRight+margen?
1698+ 9567 30 2D            JR NC, .cwNoOverlap                 ; no → fuera
1699+ 9569                  ; --- Check Y ---
1700+ 9569 3A 77 87         LD A, (WellPosY)
1701+ 956C C6 18            ADD A, 24                           ; C = wellY + 16 + 8
1702+ 956E 4F               LD C, A
